## Delivered

- Two relational journeys using real migrations, intake/extraction/review
  workflows, `SqlIntakeStore`, `SqlExtractionStore`, and
  `SqlReviewRecordRepository`, ending in one persisted T4 review association
  with medical evidence retained separately, plus a whole-database PII sweep.
- A real-composition HTTP journey with the shipped deterministic provider and
  Development encrypted reader: T4/medical extraction, correction, duplicate
  resolution, classification override, explicit acceptance, and finalization.
- Safe-404 equivalence across all eight extraction routes for foreign and
  missing resources, with no mutation.
- Planted SIN/source/provider/patient capture checks, including intermediate
  antiforgery pages and redirect headers; runtime network-attempt observation
  validated with a blocked control request.
- Per-criterion evidence for AC-1 through AC-119 plus AC-45a, and the root
  current-state update.

